The Genesis collection, a collaboration with the London atelier E Gucewicz Studios. Designed by code, made by hand, with a tag in every temple arm.

Two thousand pieces designed and prototyped, never sold: the full run did not go to production. Prototypes shown at Breakpoint in Lisbon in November 2022, then presented at Barclays Rise in London as the proof of what a connected object could be.
